merged_at":"2026-07-27T14:53:38Z"},"body":"Nodes in shader_language.cpp should be allocated using alloc_node. This node was allocated using memnew\r\nwhich caused a memory leak since nothing deletes it.\r\n\r\nFixed by using alloc_node instead of memnew\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\nmemory leak in shader_language.cpp\r\nwhen using constants with braces initialization\r\nexample:\r\nconst float numbers[5] = {0.0, 1.0, 2.0, 3.0, 4.0};\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\nfound using asan","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120126/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120126/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}